  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The works to which this consent relates, must be begun not later than the expiration of five years beginning with the date of this consent.",
    "Condition : 2 - .",
    "Condition : 3 - 3\tDetailed drawings showing the following modifications:\r\na)\tsuitable division/nibs between the front and rear rooms (1st Floor)\r\nshall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Authority before the commence of the relevant works.\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - 5\tSamples of all new work to match and method statements for repair work to existing internal features listed below:\r\na)\tplasterwork\r\nb)\tcornices\r\nc)\tarchitrave\r\nd)\tskirting, \r\ne)\tdoors\r\nf)\tshutters\r\ng)\tbrackets\r\nh)\tdecorative bolections, dado or panelling (to include positioning and location)\r\ni)\tflooring \r\nshall be submitted and agreed on site and in writing by the Local Authority before the commence of the relevant work.\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - The position, type and manner of installation of all new and relocated services and related fittings shall be specified in writing in advance of any work being carried out, and the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority must be obtained wherever these installations are to be visible or where ducts or other methods of concealment are proposed.\r\n",
    "Condition : 6 - The primary use of the first floor of the premises shall be Class C3 (residential) use and for no other purpose, including any other purpose in Class C of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification."
